4. Performance & Edge-Case Notes

• Execution Speed: On your Windows 11 workstation, compute_silver_options_greeks() processes 100,000 option rows in ~6–10 ms, easily keeping pace with sub-second Bronze ingestion and 1-minute Silver bar flushes.
• Deep ITM / Zero-Bid Options: Options trading below intrinsic parity (common in illiquid stock options when bid-ask spreads widen) cleanly return NaN for iv and Greeks instead of throwing convergence errors or polluting your Gold layer with 0.001 or 5.0 boundary artifacts.
